  "ingredients": [
    "6 large egg (separated)",
    "1/4 cup erythritol",
    "6 drop liquid stevia (~25 drops)",
    "2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "6 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "1/4 cup unflavored low-carb protein powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon cream of tartar",
    "1 1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1 tablespoon ground cinnamon",
    "1/4 cup butter",
    "1/4 cup low-carb maple syrup",
    "1/4 cup erythritol"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 325F (300F if using a glass baking dish). Separate the yolks from the egg whites. Cream the egg yolks together with the erythritol, liquid stevia, and vanilla.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ultimate-keto-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-51045-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_9688.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once creamed, add the cream cheese and protein powder. Mix well to form a thick batter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ultimate-keto-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-51045-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_9691.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat the egg whites together with cream of tartar until stiff peaks form. Fold the egg whites into the egg yolk mixture one half at a time. Pour the batter into a round cake pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ultimate-keto-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-51045-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_9693.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare the filling by combining the almond flour, cinnamon, butter, Ruled.Me Maple Syrup, and erythritol to create a dough-like mixture. Take half of this mixture and rip it into little pieces; place them in the cake batter, pushing them down with your fingers if they don't sink.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ultimate-keto-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-51045-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_9698.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 20 minutes and then top with the remaining cinnamon filling. Bake for another 20–30 minutes or until a toothpick comes out clean. Let cool for 20 minutes before removing from the cake pan. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/ultimate-keto-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-51045-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/CoffeeCake3.jpg"
    }
  ],
